ot=\"ep\" jsuid=\"XHknkb_28\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"cjmLxf#dPtwvc\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"XHknkb_29\">Political Science (Class J):<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> Covers political theory, legislative bodies, and international relations.<span jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"gWOIub#gnsrYb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"XHknkb_2a\"> [2, 3] <!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li><li data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"uJpRZe#rJqRnf\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"XHknkb_2b\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"cjmLxf#dPtwvc\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"XHknkb_2c\">Law (Class K):<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> Covers regional, national, and international legal systems.<span jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"gWOIub#gnsrYb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"XHknkb_2d\"> [2, 3] <!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li><li data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"uJpRZe#rJqRnf\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"XHknkb_2e\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"cjmLxf#dPtwvc\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"XHknkb_2f\">Education (Class L):<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> Covers the theory, practice, and history of education.<span jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"gWOIub#gnsrYb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"XHknkb_2g\"> [2, 3] <!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li><li data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"uJpRZe#rJqRnf\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"XHknkb_2h\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"cjmLxf#dPtwvc\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"XHknkb_2i\">Anthropology &amp; Geography (Class G):<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><div data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"qhbHec#lPvkWe\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"XHknkb_2j\"><div></div><ul><li data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"uJpRZe#rJqRnf\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"XHknkb_2k\"><em style=\"font-weight: inherit;\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"ABoAEd#jBqpid\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"XHknkb_2l\">G–GF:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em> Geography (Physical, Human, and Cultural)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li><li data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"uJpRZe#rJqRnf\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"XHknkb_2m\"><em style=\"font-weight: inherit;\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"ABoAEd#jBqpid\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"XHknkb_2n\">GN:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em> Anthropology &amp; Ethnology<span jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"gWOIub#gnsrYb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"XHknkb_2o\"> [2, 4] <!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li></ul><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li><li data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"uJpRZe#rJqRnf\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"XHknkb_2p\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"cjmLxf#dPtwvc\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"XHknkb_2q\">Psychology (Class B):<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> Specifically housed under <span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"cjmLxf#dPtwvc\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"XHknkb_2r\">Subclass BF<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> (within Philosophy, Psychology, and Religion).<span jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"gWOIub#gnsrYb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"XHknkb_2s\"> [2, 5] <!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li><li data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"uJpRZe#rJqRnf\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"XHknkb_2t\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"cjmLxf#dPtwvc\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"XHknkb_2u\">History (Classes C, D, E, F):<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><div data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"qhbHec#lPvkWe\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"XHknkb_2v\"><div></div><ul><li data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"uJpRZe#rJqRnf\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"XHknkb_2w\"><em style=\"font-weight: inherit;\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"ABoAEd#jBqpid\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"XHknkb_2x\">C:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em> Auxiliary Sciences of History (Archeology, Genealogy, Numismatics)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li><li data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"uJpRZe#rJqRnf\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"XHknkb_2y\"><em style=\"font-weight: inherit;\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"ABoAEd#jBqpid\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"XHknkb_2z\">D:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em> World History (Old World, Europe, Asia, Africa)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li><li data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"uJpRZe#rJqRnf\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"XHknkb_30\"><em style=\"font-weight: inherit;\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"ABoAEd#jBqpid\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"XHknkb_31\">E–F:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em> History of the Americas &amp; United States<span jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"gWOIub#gnsrYb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"XHknkb_32\"> [2, 3] <!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li></ul><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li><li data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"uJpRZe#rJqRnf\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"XHknkb_33\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"cjmLxf#dPtwvc\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"XHknkb_34\">Linguistics (Class P):<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> Housed under <span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"cjmLxf#dPtwvc\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"XHknkb_35\">Subclass P<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> (Philology and Linguistics general).<span jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"gWOIub#gnsrYb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"XHknkb_36\"> [2]</span></li></ul></div><div jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"kVZO2c#SfSkjb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"XHknkb_3b\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><div jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"cU6Yt#LBga0c\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"XHknkb_3c\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><div jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"cU6Yt#LBga0c\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"XHknkb_3d\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>"
  },
