  {
    "id": 1789447776635,
    "title": "Cultural",
    "content": "<div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 16px 0px;\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"xUgpab#A1M9vc\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_0\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">🏛️ 1. Culture &amp; Way of Life (Broad Overview)</span></div><div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 16px 0px;\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"xUgpab#A1M9vc\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_7\">Books exploring culture from an anthropological or sociological lens are classified under the <span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"cjmLxf#dPtwvc\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_8\">300 Social Sciences<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> main class.<span jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"gWOIub#gnsrYb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_9\"> [3, 4]</span></div><div data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"qhbHec#lPvkWe\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_a\"><ul><li data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"uJpRZe#rJqRnf\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_c\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"cjmLxf#dPtwvc\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_d\"><a href=\"https://www.oclc.org/content/dam/oclc/webdewey/help/300.pdf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"SKtXpe#xR6Anb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_e\">306 Culture and Institutions<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></a>:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> This is the core classification for general books on culture, mass media, popular culture, and cultural anthropology.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li><li data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"uJpRZe#rJqRnf\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_f\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"cjmLxf#dPtwvc\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_g\">306.09:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> Historical and geographical treatment of specific cultures or civilizations.<span jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"gWOIub#gnsrYb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_h\"> [4]</span></li></ul><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><hr style=\"height: 1px; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-style: solid none none; border-color: rgb(220, 223, 229) currentcolor currentcolor; border-image: none;\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"zJhOJc#fwBjOe\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_j\" data-sfc-pl=\"|||[]\"><h2 style=\"font-size: 20px;\" role=\"heading\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"gjwZNd#ZxCkTb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_k\">👥 2. Social Habits, Customs &amp; Etiquette<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></h2><div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 16px 0px;\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"xUgpab#A1M9vc\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_l\">Daily traditions, folkways, and societal behaviors are separated from general sociology and given their own dedicated division.<span jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"gWOIub#gnsrYb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_m\"> [3]</span></div><div data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"qhbHec#lPvkWe\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_n\"><ul><li data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"uJpRZe#rJqRnf\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_p\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"cjmLxf#dPtwvc\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_q\"><a href=\"https://moreheadstate.libguides.com/c.php?g=1234694&amp;p=9035257\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"SKtXpe#xR6Anb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_r\">390 Customs, Etiquette, Folklore<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></a>:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> The main home for ancestral traditions and societal manners.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li><li data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"uJpRZe#rJqRnf\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_s\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"cjmLxf#dPtwvc\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_t\">391 Costume and Personal Appearance:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> Cultural dress, fashion history, and body ornamentation.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li><li data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"uJpRZe#rJqRnf\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_u\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"cjmLxf#dPtwvc\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_v\">392 Customs of Life Cycle &amp; Domestic Life:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> Rituals surrounding birth, coming-of-age, marriage, and family structures.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li><li data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"uJpRZe#rJqRnf\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_w\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"cjmLxf#dPtwvc\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_x\">394 General Customs:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> Holidays, seasonal festivals, dining/food habits, and public celebrations.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li><li data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"uJpRZe#rJqRnf\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_y\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"cjmLxf#dPtwvc\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_z\">395 Etiquette:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> Rules of social politeness and manners across different societies.<span jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"gWOIub#gnsrYb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_10\"> [1, 3, 5]</span></li></ul><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><hr style=\"height: 1px; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-style: solid none none; border-color: rgb(220, 223, 229) currentcolor currentcolor; border-image: none;\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"zJhOJc#fwBjOe\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_12\" data-sfc-pl=\"|||[]\"><h2 style=\"font-size: 20px;\" role=\"heading\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"gjwZNd#ZxCkTb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_13\">🎨 3. The Arts &amp; Creative Expression<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></h2><div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 16px 0px;\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"xUgpab#A1M9vc\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_14\">When looking at culture through its artistic output, materials shift completely into the <span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"cjmLxf#dPtwvc\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_15\">700s and 800s<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span>.<span jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"gWOIub#gnsrYb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_16\"> [6]</span></div><div data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"qhbHec#lPvkWe\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_18\"><ul><li data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"uJpRZe#rJqRnf\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_1a\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"cjmLxf#dPtwvc\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_1b\"><a href=\"https://www.library.illinois.edu/infosci/research/guides/dewey/\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"SKtXpe#xR6Anb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_1c\">700 The Arts &amp; Recreation<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></a>:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> The main class for creative and fine arts.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li><li data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"uJpRZe#rJqRnf\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_1d\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"cjmLxf#dPtwvc\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_1e\">720 Architecture:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> Cultural building styles and historic structures.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li><li data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"uJpRZe#rJqRnf\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_1f\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"cjmLxf#dPtwvc\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_1g\">730–760 Visual Arts:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> Sculpture, ceramics, textiles, and painting.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li><li data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"uJpRZe#rJqRnf\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_1h\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"cjmLxf#dPtwvc\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_1i\">780 Music:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> Traditional folk music, instruments, and cultural audio expressions.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li><li data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"uJpRZe#rJqRnf\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_1j\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"cjmLxf#dPtwvc\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_1k\">790 Performing Arts:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> Cultural dance, theater, and traditional games.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li><li data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"uJpRZe#rJqRnf\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_1l\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"cjmLxf#dPtwvc\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_1m\">800 Literature:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> Poems, plays, folklore, and stories written by a specific cultural group.<span jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"gWOIub#gnsrYb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_1n\"> [6, 7, 8, 9, 10]</span></li></ul><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><hr style=\"height: 1px; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-style: solid none none; border-color: rgb(220, 223, 229) currentcolor currentcolor; border-image: none;\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"zJhOJc#fwBjOe\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_1p\" data-sfc-pl=\"|||[]\"><h2 style=\"font-size: 20px;\" role=\"heading\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"gjwZNd#ZxCkTb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_1q\">📿 4. Beliefs, Values &amp; Philosophy<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></h2><div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 16px 0px;\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"xUgpab#A1M9vc\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_1r\">Shared moral codes, spiritual guidelines, and existential philosophies are found at the beginning of the DDC system.<span jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"gWOIub#gnsrYb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_1s\"> [6]</span></div><div data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"qhbHec#lPvkWe\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_1t\"><ul><li data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"uJpRZe#rJqRnf\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_1v\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"cjmLxf#dPtwvc\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_1w\">100 Philosophy &amp; Psychology:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> Houses systems of thought, ethics, and values held by specific civilizations.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li><li data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"uJpRZe#rJqRnf\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_1x\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"cjmLxf#dPtwvc\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_1y\">170 Ethics:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> Cultural moral values, notions of honor, and community duties.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li><li data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"uJpRZe#rJqRnf\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_1z\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"cjmLxf#dPtwvc\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_20\">200 Religion:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> Spiritual beliefs, mythologies, and religious practices.<span jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"gWOIub#gnsrYb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_21\"> [6, 8, 10]</span></li></ul><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><hr style=\"height: 1px; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-style: solid none none; border-color: rgb(220, 223, 229) currentcolor currentcolor; border-image: none;\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"zJhOJc#fwBjOe\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_23\" data-sfc-pl=\"|||[]\"><h2 style=\"font-size: 20px;\" role=\"heading\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"gjwZNd#ZxCkTb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_24\">📜 5. Heritage &amp; Legacy<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></h2><div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 16px 0px;\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"xUgpab#A1M9vc\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_25\">The physical and historical tracking of a culture's legacy is found in the final main class.<span jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"gWOIub#gnsrYb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_26\"> [6]</span></div><div data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"qhbHec#lPvkWe\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_27\"><ul><li data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"uJpRZe#rJqRnf\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_29\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"cjmLxf#dPtwvc\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_2a\"><a href=\"https://esu.libguides.com/dewey\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"SKtXpe#xR6Anb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_2b\">900 History &amp; Geography<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></a>:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> The overarching home for historical accounts of a people.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li><li data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"uJpRZe#rJqRnf\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_2c\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"cjmLxf#dPtwvc\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_2d\">930–990 History of the Specific World Areas:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> Books documenting the tangible heritage, archeology, and chronological timeline of specific ethnic groups or nations.<span jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"gWOIub#gnsrYb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_2e\"> [4, 6, 11]</span></li></ul><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 16px 0px;\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"xUgpab#A1M9vc\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_2g\">Are you trying to <span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"cjmLxf#dPtwvc\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_2h\">catalog a specific collection<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> of books, or do you need help <span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"cjmLxf#dPtwvc\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"JH9DBf_2i\">finding the exact decimal numbers<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> for a particular country or ethnic group's culture?<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><div jsaction=\"\" jscontrol